# Provider binaries and the lock naming their hashes per platform. The lock is
# normally committed. It is not here because nothing has been applied, so pinning
# hashes resolved on one throwaway container would claim a reproducibility this
# directory does not have. It gets committed on the first run that produces a plan.
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl

# State, and the variable file holding the project id. Neither belongs here.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
